{"latest_judgment":{"docno":null,"relevance":0,"reason":"The Teen Ink query returned no results.","learned":"No matching Teen Ink teen-authored anti-animal-testing results were found in this corpus."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ (+ children kids teens teenagers) \"animal testing\" (+ campaign petition protest boycott))","reason":"Broaden to children/kids as well as teens with concrete action terms to find youth-led evidence against animal testing."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ (+ children kids teens teenagers) \"animal testing\" (+ campaign petition protest boycott))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_33_277727373#3_627977277","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q999","rank":1,"snippet":"Essay in English FAQ’s on Animal Testing Essay \" , \"segment\": \"It is unethical to make animals the recipients of harmful drugs and chemicals only because they cannot protest. Testing includes brutal treatment like water deprivation, starvation, force-feeding of unhealthy and non-edible substances, pain stimulation, and other such heinous treatment. Animals have no choice but to endure the pain and slow death. It is nothing less than torture. People use animals, and when they are too damaged, they are ‘put down’ or killed. There are animal laws or rights, and they should include the law that protects them from such treatment. Animals should have legal rights too. We should not forget that we are a part of the living organism and so are animals. It is an unacceptable practice to use animals solely for our benefit. Many animal rights activists strongly <cover>protest this practice.\" , \"start_char\": 1715.000000 , \"title\": \"Animal Testing Essay | Essay on Animal Testing for Students and Children </cover>in English - A Plus Topper\" , \"url\": \"https://www.aplustopper.com/animal-testing-essay/\" }"}}
{"request":{"judgments":"7/50"}}
