{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ (+ \"youth campaign\" \"youth activist\" \"young people\" students) (+ \"animal testing\" \"animal-tested\" \"tested on animals\") (+ \"cruelty-free\" petition boycott protest))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_39_1027404656#10_2062513091","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q1021","rank":7,"snippet":"have something new to give to the audience for an old topic, a new study, a new incident, etc., you can take the chance of going with a common topic. It will then be a test of your skills how you build interest in the audience. Has the Desired Outcome All persuasive speeches aim to motivate the audience to do something. So select a topic basis of what is your desired action from the people. E.g. could be you want them to plant more trees, or you want them to <cover>boycott using cosmetics tested on animals, etc. List of 100 Best Persuasive Speech Topics For College Students</cover>If you still cannot make up your mind about which topic to go with, here is an exhaustive list of easy persuasive speech topics for college students. We have categorized the topics under 12 broad categories. Business Does advertising have a lot of mind games? Do introverts make great business leaders?\" , \"start_char\": 4657.000000 , \"title\": \"Best Persuasive Speech Topics for College: 100 Persuasive Speech Ideas for College | EssayWriter4U\" , \"url\": \"https://www.essaywriter4u.com/","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_43_348846183#7_766499917","rank":1,"relevance":2},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_39_1027404656#11_2062515192","rank":2,"relevance":1},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_01_398008495#6_359901346","rank":3,"relevance":1},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_33_277727373#13_627992154","rank":4,"relevance":2},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_33_277727373#3_627977277","rank":5,"relevance":1},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_15_1712296447#7_3409221057","rank":6,"relevance":2}]}}
